          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiterereŋ tokona anacamit kon ŋituŋa a ekal a eketiyan kon, ikotere erubakinete ŋikaru ka ŋikaru erae ŋulu kon ŋulu ikikinyomito iyoŋ. Idau iyoŋ okoe Ekapolon Akuj alimun ŋun, ido eyakaun arereŋu kon ŋin neni a ŋituŋa a ekal a eketiyan kon ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.”",
          "type": "text",
